天哪。

1241
00:56:07.400 --> 00:56:12.180
I don't know how this turned into stories about our early days working.
我不知道怎么就聊到了我们早期的工作故事。

1242
00:56:12.520 --> 00:56:14.540
But apparently we needed to get this out.
但显然我们需要把这些说出来。

1243
00:56:14.700 --> 00:56:15.560
It's therapeutic, Jenna.
这很治愈，珍娜。

1244
00:56:15.740 --> 00:56:17.200
We're talking about all of our old bosses.
我们正在谈论我们所有的前老板。

1245
00:56:17.200 --> 00:56:18.240
I feel better.
我感觉好多了。

1246
00:56:18.460 --> 00:56:19.180
I do, too.
我也是。

1247
00:56:20.000 --> 00:56:21.880
Next, we're going to move into the break room.
接下来，我们要进入休息室。

1248
00:56:23.160 --> 00:56:25.860
D'Angelo is having lunch.
迪安杰洛正在吃午饭。

1249
00:56:26.700 --> 00:56:28.180
Did you look at his plate?
你看到他的盘子了吗？

1250
00:56:28.800 --> 00:56:30.700
Can we talk about it for a second?
我们能聊聊那个吗？

1251
00:56:32.220 --> 00:56:33.580
What was on his plate?
他盘子里装的是什么？

1252
00:56:33.920 --> 00:56:35.340
Here, I took a picture of it.
给，我拍了张照片。

1253
00:56:35.900 --> 00:56:38.900
He has a Tupperware container that looks like it has broccoli.
他有个特百惠盒子，看起来里面装的是西兰花。

1254
00:56:39.820 --> 00:56:44.200
But then there's another Tupperware container that's open that looks like it has bean sprouts.
但旁边还有个打开的特百惠盒子，看起来像是豆芽。

1255
00:56:44.200 --> 00:56:46.160
But what is on his plate?
可他盘子里到底是什么？

1256
00:56:46.160 --> 00:56:49.280
Is that a stalk of lettuce?
那是根生菜吗？

1257
00:56:49.520 --> 00:56:54.900
It looks like maybe he's chopped off the bottom of the celery and he just has the top.
看起来他好像切掉了芹菜的根部，只留了顶部。

1258
00:56:55.760 --> 00:56:56.800
What is he eating?
他到底在吃什么？

1259
00:56:57.380 --> 00:56:58.240
I don't know.
我不知道。

1260
00:56:58.260 --> 00:56:59.760
He's eating a lot of nothing.
他吃了一堆空气。

1261
00:56:59.980 --> 00:57:00.940
I went to the script.
我查了剧本。

1262
00:57:01.120 --> 00:57:02.900
It doesn't have any direction.
上面没有任何说明。

1263
00:57:03.360 --> 00:57:07.620
For this, I was so very confused.
对于这一幕，我感到非常困惑。

1264
00:57:08.380 --> 00:57:11.660
Jenna, I know why he's eating all of that, but I'm not going to tell you yet.
珍娜，我知道他为什么要吃那些东西，但我现在还不能告诉你。

1265
00:57:12.200 --> 00:57:12.680
What?
什么？

1266
00:57:13.140 --> 00:57:14.380
I'm not going to tell you.
我不会告诉你的。

1267
00:57:14.640 --> 00:57:15.880
It's in the extended cut.
在加长版里有。

1268
00:57:15.880 --> 00:57:17.900
But it comes later in the episode, the explanation.
但解释会在这一集的后面出现。

1269
00:57:18.120 --> 00:57:19.220
I'm going to save it.
我要先卖个关子。

1270
00:57:19.880 --> 00:57:24.020
Well, I was very confused when the scene opened, so I'm excited that I'm going to get some answers.
好吧，这一幕刚开始时我非常困惑，所以我很期待能得到答案。

1271
00:57:24.960 --> 00:57:25.380
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1272
00:57:25.640 --> 00:57:25.960
Okay.
好吧。

1273
00:57:26.540 --> 00:57:28.620
Well, Andy thinks he's written the perfect joke.
安迪觉得他写出了一个完美的笑话。

1274
00:57:28.800 --> 00:57:31.480
He's going to tell D'Angelo since he's the office funny guy.
他打算讲给迪安杰洛听，因为他是办公室里的搞笑担当。

1275
00:57:32.080 --> 00:57:34.420
D'Angelo doesn't even think he's telling a joke.
迪安杰洛甚至没觉得他在讲笑话。

1276
00:57:34.600 --> 00:57:35.720
He thinks he's getting political.
他以为安迪在谈论政治。

1277
00:57:35.720 --> 00:57:36.560
And he's like, you know what?
于是他说，你知道吗？

1278
00:57:36.680 --> 00:57:38.400
Just stick to being the funny guy.
你就做好你的搞笑担当就行了。

1279
00:57:38.560 --> 00:57:38.880
All right?
好吗？

1280
00:57:39.100 --> 00:57:39.960
You're the funny guy.
你是搞笑担当。

1281
00:57:40.120 --> 00:57:40.720
No politics.
别谈政治。

1282
00:57:40.980 --> 00:57:41.820
Just be the funny guy.
只管搞笑就行。

1283
00:57:42.580 --> 00:57:43.380
Poor Andy.
可怜的安迪。

1284
00:57:44.900 --> 00:57:45.840
Andy's like, okay.
安迪回了句，好的。

1285
00:57:45.840 --> 00:57:47.460
And he starts to back out of the room.
然后他开始退着走出房间。

1286
00:57:47.620 --> 00:57:52.300
And he legitimately trips and kind of falls on this table, and it all tips over.
结果他真的被绊了一下，整个人撞在桌子上，桌子全翻了。

1287
00:57:52.500 --> 00:57:54.420
And D'Angelo's like, yes!
迪安杰洛就说，太棒了！

1288
00:57:54.800 --> 00:57:55.720
Funny guy!
搞笑担当！

1289
00:57:55.720 --> 00:57:58.560
We had a fan catch from Shannon M.
我们收到了一位粉丝的发现，来自密歇根州克林顿镇的香农·M。

1290
00:57:58.780 --> 00:58:00.960
in Clinton Township, Michigan, who said,
她说，

1291
00:58:01.160 --> 00:58:05.740
At 14 minutes and 50 seconds, when Andy trips and falls and pulls the table down,
在14分50秒时，当安迪被绊倒并把桌子拉翻时，

1292
00:58:05.940 --> 00:58:12.160
As the table is going down, I noticed a blue square under the table and thought it might be a sticky note
桌子倒下的时候，我注意到桌子底下有个蓝色方块，我想那可能是一张便利贴，

1293
00:58:12.160 --> 00:58:16.920
telling production what set this table belongs to and what position it goes in which room.
用来告诉制作组这张桌子属于哪个布景，以及它在房间里的摆放位置。

1294
00:58:17.060 --> 00:58:18.020
Am I right?
我说得对吗？

1295
00:58:18.700 --> 00:58:19.580
Yes, Shannon.
没错，香农。

1296
00:58:19.940 --> 00:58:20.520
You are right.
你说对了。

1297
00:58:20.520 --> 00:58:26.100
Remember when we saw that sticky tape under Pam's desk that said Pam's desk?
还记得我们看到帕姆桌子底下贴着写有“帕姆的桌子”的胶带吗？

1298
00:58:26.540 --> 00:58:26.720
Yeah.
记得。

1299
00:58:27.260 --> 00:58:31.740
They had little pieces of tape on all of the furniture saying what it was and where it went.
他们所有的家具上都贴了小纸条，写着那是什么以及该放在哪里。

1300
00:58:32.200 --> 00:58:37.400
One of the things that just delights me is that everyone is becoming so good at background catches,
最让我高兴的一点是，大家现在都变得这么擅长捕捉背景细节了。

1301
00:58:37.400 --> 00:58:40.360
and I can't wait to see what people catch each week.
我迫不及待想看看大家每周会捕捉到什么细节。

1302
00:58:40.860 --> 00:58:43.100
D'Angelo's going to get a huge box.
迪安杰洛会收到一个大箱子。

1303
00:58:43.400 --> 00:58:44.920
Aaron's like, your stuff is here.
亚伦会说，你的东西到了。

1304
00:58:45.320 --> 00:58:46.800
Everyone gathers around.
大家围了过来。

1305
00:58:46.800 --> 00:58:49.360
It's a lot of Southwest decor.
里面有很多西南风格的装饰品。

1306
00:58:49.360 --> 00:58:52.640
Or, it reminded me of the stuff in our trailers.
或者说，这让我想起了我们拖车里的那些东西。

1307
00:58:53.420 --> 00:58:56.600
Remember, our trailers had a Southwest decor.
记得吗，我们的拖车就是西南风格的装饰。

1308
00:58:57.160 --> 00:58:57.340
Yeah.
是啊。

1309
00:58:58.020 --> 00:59:00.820
Michael has a talking head where he says, you know, D'Angelo's a great guy.
迈克尔有个采访镜头，他说，你知道，迪安杰洛是个很棒的人。

1310
00:59:00.920 --> 00:59:01.620
He loves the guy.
他很喜欢那个人。

1311
00:59:01.760 --> 00:59:03.700
He's not sure if he's the right fit for the office.
但他不确定他是否适合这个办公室。

1312
00:59:03.920 --> 00:59:05.320
Also, I'm not sure if I love the guy.
另外，我也不确定我是否喜欢那个人。

1313
00:59:05.980 --> 00:59:06.200
Yeah.
是啊。

1314
00:59:06.580 --> 00:59:08.960
People are going to keep trying to suck up to D'Angelo.
大家会不断地试图讨好迪安杰洛。

1315
00:59:09.120 --> 00:59:13.720
Daryl's sister is going to swing by the office and drop off some cowboy boots
达里尔的妹妹会顺道来办公室送几双牛仔靴，

1316
00:59:13.720 --> 00:59:17.320
and a cowboy hat that Daryl is now going to wear.
还有一顶牛仔帽，达里尔现在要戴上它。

1317
00:59:17.320 --> 00:59:19.580
Yeah, he had a talking head.
没错，他有个采访镜头。

1318
00:59:19.580 --> 00:59:23.520
It's in the extended cut that explains his new love of the SouthweSt.
在加长版里解释了他对西南风格的新热爱。

1319
00:59:23.920 --> 00:59:24.480
Let's hear it.
让我们听听看。

1320
00:59:25.580 --> 00:59:25.780
No.
不。

1321
00:59:26.240 --> 00:59:28.040
I've always loved the SouthweSt.
我一直都很喜欢西南风格。

1322
00:59:28.360 --> 00:59:29.900
I got a lot of this stuff at home.
我在家里有很多这样的东西。

1323
00:59:30.240 --> 00:59:33.760
You know, turquoise and rocks.
你知道，绿松石和石头之类的。

1324
00:59:35.080 --> 00:59:36.340
I need this job, man.
伙计，我需要这份工作。

1325
00:59:39.500 --> 00:59:40.400
He just looks very—
他看起来非常——

1326
00:59:40.400 --> 00:59:41.340
I mean, he gets right to the point.
我是说，他直奔主题。

1327
00:59:41.460 --> 00:59:41.660
Yeah.
是啊。

1328
00:59:41.860 --> 00:59:44.900
He starts, like, going off, and then he's like, who am I kidding?
他开始滔滔不绝，然后又说，我这是在骗谁呢？

1329
00:59:45.060 --> 00:59:46.500
Look, I just need this job, okay?
听着，我只是需要这份工作，好吗？

1330
00:59:47.080 --> 00:59:50.880
Poor Andy is now going to walk past D'Angelo on his way to the bathroom.
可怜的安迪现在要去洗手间，路过迪安杰洛身边。

1331
00:59:51.560 --> 00:59:54.120
And once again, he's got to be office funny guy.
他又一次不得不扮演办公室里的开心果。

1332
00:59:54.280 --> 00:59:55.840
I so related to him in this moment.
这一刻我太有共鸣了。

1333
00:59:55.840 --> 00:59:57.800
This would be like me just wanting to go to the bathroom.
这就好比我只是想去个洗手间。

1334
00:59:57.800 --> 01:00:03.060
But now my boss is like, hey, sketch comedy girl, be funny, do a sketch, do an accent.
但现在我的老板却说，嘿，那个演小品的女孩，搞笑点，演个小品，来个口音。

1335
01:00:03.440 --> 01:00:05.520
And I'm like, I'm just getting the key to go pee.
而我心里想的是，我只是去拿钥匙上个厕所。

1336
01:00:05.780 --> 01:00:06.020
Thanks.
谢谢。

1337
01:00:06.720 --> 01:00:12.140
So in this scene, Andy is first going to kind of do, like, some funny miming.
所以在这场戏里，安迪首先会做一些滑稽的哑剧动作。

1338
01:00:12.620 --> 01:00:14.100
Yeah, like he's pulling a rope.
对，就像他在拉绳子一样。

1339
01:00:14.580 --> 01:00:14.920
Yeah.
是啊。

1340
01:00:15.180 --> 01:00:18.440
But D'Angelo is not liking it until it escalates.
但迪安杰洛并不买账，直到事情升级。

1341
01:00:18.620 --> 01:00:23.200
He's going to pour hot coffee on his crotch, which really makes D'Angelo laugh.
他会把热咖啡倒在自己的胯部，这真的让迪安杰洛笑了。

1342
01:00:23.200 --> 01:00:26.720
And then D'Angelo says, drink this hand soap.
然后迪安杰洛说，把这洗手液喝了。

1343
01:00:26.940 --> 01:00:30.740
And Andy starts pumping the hand soap into his mouth.
于是安迪开始把洗手液挤进嘴里。

1344
01:00:31.480 --> 01:00:31.640
Yeah.
是啊。

1345
01:00:31.820 --> 01:00:37.540
This is after he's stuck his hand in a toaster, tossed tea bags, and cheese puffs all over himself.
这发生在他把手伸进烤面包机，把茶包和芝士泡芙撒得满身都是之后。

1346
01:00:37.780 --> 01:00:41.180
I had to look in the script about this.
我不得不去查了查剧本。

1347
01:00:41.300 --> 01:00:42.460
I wanted to know.
我想知道。

1348
01:00:42.620 --> 01:00:44.660
What was written and what was improvised?
哪些是剧本写的，哪些是即兴发挥的？

1349
01:00:44.820 --> 01:00:51.780
Yes, because I felt like I could see a glimmer in Will's eyes when he said,
没错，因为我觉得当威尔说出那句时，我能看到他眼中的闪光，

1350
01:00:51.780 --> 01:00:53.640
drink this hand soap.
把这洗手液喝了。

1351
01:00:53.780 --> 01:00:59.680
And I felt like I saw Ed kind of laugh at the idea as Ed, but then do it.
我觉得我看到埃德当时以埃德的身份对这个主意笑了笑，但还是照做了。

1352
01:01:00.320 --> 01:01:01.880
It is not scripted.
这不是剧本里写的。

1353
01:01:02.020 --> 01:01:02.840
Oh, no.
噢，不。

1354
01:01:03.300 --> 01:01:10.520
I texted Ed and Ed said it was an improv by Will and he gave it a big old yes and.
我给埃德发了短信，他说那是威尔的即兴发挥，他欣然接受并顺着演了下去。

1355
01:01:10.920 --> 01:01:12.780
What did he squirt in his mouth?
他往嘴里喷了什么？

1356
01:01:12.980 --> 01:01:13.700
Did he actually?
他真的喷了吗？

1357
01:01:14.000 --> 01:01:14.820
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1358
01:01:15.280 --> 01:01:16.360
It was just sitting there.
它就放在那儿。

1359
01:01:16.520 --> 01:01:17.320
He just did it.
他直接就用了。

1360
01:01:17.320 --> 01:01:24.020
And I feel like Will was joking when he said, do the hand soap, because the scene was over.
我觉得威尔说“用洗手液吧”的时候是在开玩笑，因为那场戏已经结束了。

1361
01:01:24.420 --> 01:01:24.500
Right.
没错。

1362
01:01:24.500 --> 01:01:26.820
The scene was supposed to end with the hot coffee.
那场戏原本应该在热咖啡那里结束的。

1363
01:01:27.020 --> 01:01:29.940
And I think Will was kidding because you can even see.
我觉得威尔是在开玩笑，因为你甚至能看出来。

1364
01:01:30.040 --> 01:01:34.900
I feel like knowing Will, he's like, do the hand soap, like as a bit, as a joke.
了解威尔的话，你会觉得他当时说“用洗手液”只是为了搞怪，开个玩笑。

1365
01:01:35.060 --> 01:01:37.840
But Ed was like, OK, I'm up for it.
但埃德却说，好吧，我没问题。

1366
01:01:37.940 --> 01:01:43.100
And you can kind of see in the scene, Ed's pumping it, but it's really just hitting his lips.
你可以在戏里看出来，埃德在按压洗手液，但其实只是喷到了嘴唇上。

1367
01:01:43.100 --> 01:01:45.120
It's not going all the way in his mouth.
并没有完全进到嘴里。

1368
01:01:45.780 --> 01:01:48.260
But yeah, that was a fun text exchange with Ed.
不过确实，那次和埃德的短信交流很有趣。

1369
01:01:48.400 --> 01:01:49.960
He enjoyed remembering that moment.
他很享受回忆那一刻。

1370
01:01:50.400 --> 01:01:54.440
It's going to cut to an Andy talking head where he's like, I guess this is my life now.
镜头会切到安迪的采访片段，他说，我想这就是我以后的生活了。

1371
01:01:56.600 --> 01:02:01.680
So after this Andy talking head, Jenna, we would have found out a little backstory
所以在安迪的这段采访之后，珍娜，我们本会了解到一点关于迪安杰洛的背景故事，

1372
01:02:01.680 --> 01:02:05.300
about D'Angelo that might have explained his lunch choice.
这或许能解释他午餐的选择。

1373
01:02:06.020 --> 01:02:07.560
Oh, I'm getting my answer?
噢，我要得到答案了吗？

1374
01:02:07.940 --> 01:02:08.220
Yep.
是的。

1375
01:02:08.740 --> 01:02:09.120
All right.
好吧。

1376
01:02:09.340 --> 01:02:11.440
There is a huge scene.
有一场重头戏。

1377
01:02:11.440 --> 01:02:12.720
It's in the extended cut.
在加长版里。

1378
01:02:12.720 --> 01:02:14.940
But I'm not going to play it because it's so big.
但我不会播放它，因为它太长了。

1379
01:02:15.080 --> 01:02:15.800
That's what she said.
她也是这么说的。

1380
01:02:16.360 --> 01:02:16.760
Yes.
没错。

1381
01:02:18.340 --> 01:02:21.880
Basically, Dwight wants to try to sabotage D'Angelo.
基本上，德怀特想尝试破坏迪安杰洛的形象。

1382
01:02:22.340 --> 01:02:27.480
And he finds an old photo of him where D'Angelo is very, very overweight.
他找到了一张迪安杰洛以前的照片，照片里的他非常非常胖。

1383
01:02:27.920 --> 01:02:30.840
He takes this picture and he shows it to Michael.
他拿着这张照片给迈克尔看。

1384
01:02:31.480 --> 01:02:35.720
And Michael also now wants to sabotage D'Angelo, right?
于是迈克尔现在也想破坏迪安杰洛的形象，对吧？

1385
01:02:35.800 --> 01:02:36.960
Because everyone likes him.
因为大家都喜欢他。

1386
01:02:37.280 --> 01:02:41.180
So he brings it out into the bullpen and shows it to everyone.
所以他把照片带到办公区，展示给所有人看。

1387
01:02:41.180 --> 01:02:45.820
Like sort of thinking that they're going to shame D'Angelo or embarrass him in some way.
他本以为大家会羞辱迪安杰洛，或者让他难堪什么的。

1388
01:02:45.960 --> 01:02:46.580
That's right.
没错。

1389
01:02:46.820 --> 01:02:50.120
But D'Angelo walks in the room and he sees the picture being passed around.
但迪安杰洛走进房间，看到照片正在被传阅。

1390
01:02:50.340 --> 01:02:51.240
And he's like, you know what?
他说，你们知道吗？

1391
01:02:52.160 --> 01:02:56.320
Yeah, that was my life, you know, and it's taken me a long journey to get where I am.
是的，那曾是我的生活，我经历了一段漫长的旅程才走到今天。

1392
01:02:56.440 --> 01:03:02.920
And he ends up giving this very inspirational speech and tells everyone in the bullpen that
最后他发表了一番非常励志的演讲，告诉办公区里的所有人，

1393
01:03:02.920 --> 01:03:08.100
he believes in them, that they're going to be the best they can be at Dunder Mifflin because
他相信他们，相信他们能在邓德·米夫林做到最好，因为

1394
01:03:08.100 --> 01:03:09.440
he could believe in himself.
他曾经相信过自己。

1395
01:03:09.460 --> 01:03:11.540
And it ends in this rousing applause.
演讲在热烈的掌声中结束。

1396
01:03:11.740 --> 01:03:14.780
The whole team is now more behind him than ever.
整个团队现在比以往任何时候都更支持他了。

1397
01:03:14.960 --> 01:03:16.260
And Michael is so annoyed.
迈克尔感到非常恼火。

1398
01:03:16.440 --> 01:03:19.100
It completely backfired on Michael and Dwight.
这完全是搬起石头砸了自己的脚，迈克尔和德怀特失算了。

1399
01:03:19.340 --> 01:03:23.160
Well, Michael's going to have to find a new way to sabotage D'Angelo.
好吧，迈克尔得想出新办法来对付迪安杰洛了。

1400
01:03:23.320 --> 01:03:27.440
So he walks in on D'Angelo talking to all of us about whale watching.
于是他撞见迪安杰洛正在跟我们所有人谈论观鲸的事。

1401
01:03:27.440 --> 01:03:32.300
And Michael has brought in peanut butter and jelly sandwiches, even though D'Angelo has
迈克尔带了花生酱果酱三明治来，尽管迪安杰洛

1402
01:03:32.300 --> 01:03:33.700
a serious peanut allergy.
有严重的花生过敏。

1403
01:03:34.020 --> 01:03:38.040
His allergy is so serious, we find out it makes him itchy for a few days.
他的过敏非常严重，我们发现这会让他发痒好几天。

1404
01:03:38.520 --> 01:03:38.880
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1405
01:03:39.380 --> 01:03:39.840
Yes.
是的。

1406
01:03:40.140 --> 01:03:46.120
I got curious about whale watching because D'Angelo is saying the best whale watching is
我对观鲸产生了好奇，因为迪安杰洛说最好的观鲸地点

1407
01:03:46.120 --> 01:03:47.120
on the West CoaSt.
在西海岸。

1408
01:03:47.760 --> 01:03:48.320
Yeah.
没错。

1409
01:03:48.520 --> 01:03:49.480
Not the East CoaSt.
不是东海岸。

1410
01:03:49.780 --> 01:03:51.060
Well, he loves the WeSt.
嗯，他很喜欢西部。

1411
01:03:51.300 --> 01:03:52.340
He sure does.
他确实很喜欢。

1412
01:03:52.340 --> 01:03:58.660
According to an article in Local Adventurer called The 15 Best Places to Whale Watch in
根据《当地探险家》上一篇名为《美国15个最佳观鲸地点》的文章，

1413
01:03:58.660 --> 01:04:04.700
the U.S., the best whale watching is in Glacier Bay, Alaska in June through AuguSt.
最好的观鲸地点是阿拉斯加的冰川湾，时间是六月到八月。

1414
01:04:05.200 --> 01:04:07.980
You can see humpbacks, orcas, and blue whales.
你可以看到座头鲸、虎鲸和蓝鲸。

1415
01:04:08.820 --> 01:04:12.080
Juneau, Alaska from April to November is another great spot.
四月到十一月的阿拉斯加朱诺是另一个绝佳地点。

1416
01:04:12.080 --> 01:04:15.840
And Kodiak Island in Alaska is a great place to see gray whales.
而阿拉斯加的科迪亚克岛是观看灰鲸的好地方。

1417
01:04:15.840 --> 01:04:24.120
In fact, Angela, every April, Kodiak, Alaska has a 10-day festival celebrating the return
事实上，安吉拉，每年四月，阿拉斯加的科迪亚克都会举办为期10天的节日，庆祝

1418
01:04:24.120 --> 01:04:26.840
of the Eastern Pacific gray whale to the area.
东太平洋灰鲸回归该地区。

1419
01:04:27.300 --> 01:04:28.140
What do you think?
你觉得怎么样？

1420
01:04:28.320 --> 01:04:29.200
Sign me up.
算我一个。

1421
01:04:29.620 --> 01:04:31.880
I think we need to go to this festival.
我觉得我们需要去参加这个节日。

1422
01:04:32.120 --> 01:04:32.880
I think that's a yes.
我想这是同意了。

1423
01:04:33.360 --> 01:04:35.200
Anyone out there ever been to the festival?
有谁去过这个节日吗？

1424
01:04:35.440 --> 01:04:36.680
What tips can you give us?
能给我们什么建议吗？

1425
01:04:36.800 --> 01:04:37.980
What can you tell us about it?
能告诉我们关于它的什么信息吗？

1426
01:04:38.480 --> 01:04:39.200
10 days.
10天。

1427
01:04:39.460 --> 01:04:40.640
That's a big festival.
那是个盛大的节日。

1428
01:04:40.900 --> 01:04:41.580
It is.
确实。

1429
01:04:41.580 --> 01:04:47.340
The next top spots are all in California, Big Sur, Monterey Bay, San Diego, and Santa
接下来的顶级地点都在加利福尼亚州，大瑟尔、蒙特雷湾、圣地亚哥和圣塔

1430
01:04:47.340 --> 01:04:47.700
Barbara.
芭芭拉。

1431
01:04:48.180 --> 01:04:53.400
Also on the West Coast, you've got Hawaii and San Juan Island, Washington, and Depot Bay
同样在西海岸，还有夏威夷和华盛顿州的圣胡安群岛，以及俄勒冈州的

1432
01:04:53.400 --> 01:04:53.980
in Oregon.
德波湾。

1433
01:04:54.600 --> 01:04:58.240
But there were a few East Coast spots on the list, D'Angelo.
但名单上也有几个东海岸的地点，迪安杰洛。

1434
01:04:58.420 --> 01:04:59.560
I'm sorry to say.
很遗憾。

1435
01:05:00.100 --> 01:05:01.780
You're wrong about the East CoaSt.
你对东海岸的看法是错的。

1436
01:05:02.280 --> 01:05:07.300
If you go to Jacksonville, Florida, Cape Cod, Massachusetts, Long Island, New York, or
如果你去佛罗里达州的杰克逊维尔、马萨诸塞州的科德角、纽约州的长岛，或者

1437
01:05:07.300 --> 01:05:10.060
Virginia Beach, Virginia, there is great whale watching.
弗吉尼亚州的弗吉尼亚海滩，那里有很棒的观鲸活动。

1438
01:05:10.060 --> 01:05:11.640
So there you have it.
所以事实就是这样。

1439
01:05:12.320 --> 01:05:15.100
Well, I just like that D'Angelo brought up whale watching to begin with.
嗯，我只是喜欢迪安杰洛一开始就提到了观鲸。

1440
01:05:15.320 --> 01:05:17.040
I just like that he got the conversation going.
我只是喜欢他开启了这个话题。

1441
01:05:17.420 --> 01:05:18.880
He has a lot of interests.
他有很多兴趣爱好。

1442
01:05:19.160 --> 01:05:19.620
He does.
确实。

1443
01:05:20.800 --> 01:05:25.500
Did anyone catch the fact that Brian as Kevin caught a peanut butter and jelly sandwich
有人注意到布莱恩饰演的凯文用嘴接住了花生酱果酱三明治

1444
01:05:25.500 --> 01:05:26.060
in his mouth?
这件事吗？

1445
01:05:26.520 --> 01:05:31.360
I noticed it and I went to the script because I wanted to know if that was a scripted bit.
我注意到了，我查了剧本，因为我想知道那是不是剧本里写的桥段。

1446
01:05:32.120 --> 01:05:33.440
Here's what the script said.
剧本上是这么写的。

1447
01:05:33.720 --> 01:05:37.940
The script says Kevin tries to catch the sandwich in his mouth.
剧本说凯文尝试用嘴去接三明治。

1448
01:05:38.400 --> 01:05:40.700
So it was just that he was supposed to try.
所以他只是被要求尝试一下。

1449
01:05:40.900 --> 01:05:42.620
It was not required that he catch it.
并没有要求他一定要接住。

1450
01:05:42.780 --> 01:05:48.320
And I have a memory of us all being very delighted that he actually caught it.
我记得我们当时都非常高兴他真的接住了。

1451
01:05:48.360 --> 01:05:48.740
That he caught it.
他抓住了这一点。

1452
01:05:48.880 --> 01:05:49.240
Yeah.
没错。

1453
01:05:49.660 --> 01:05:51.720
Once again, Michael's plan does not work.
迈克尔的计划又一次失败了。

1454
01:05:51.880 --> 01:05:55.280
People are really annoyed with him that he's trying to sabotage D'Angelo.
大家对他试图破坏迪安杰洛的行为感到非常恼火。

1455
01:05:55.480 --> 01:05:57.780
And D'Angelo is going to call a meeting in the multipurpose room.
迪安杰洛打算在多功能厅召开会议。

1456
01:05:57.940 --> 01:05:58.880
He sure is.
他确实打算这么做。

1457
01:05:59.080 --> 01:06:01.800
And everyone's going to go, leaving Michael outside.
大家都会去参加，把迈克尔晾在外面。

1458
01:06:01.800 --> 01:06:05.900
But D'Angelo is going to come out of the conference room before the meeting starts.
但迪安杰洛会在会议开始前走出会议室。

1459
01:06:05.980 --> 01:06:08.220
And he's going to ask Michael for some advice.
他会向迈克尔征求一些建议。

1460
01:06:09.060 --> 01:06:11.440
He said, how do you typically start these meetings?
他说，你平时是怎么开始这些会议的？

1461
01:06:12.240 --> 01:06:15.160
Michael says he starts with a little chit chat and a couple jokes.
迈克尔说他通常会先闲聊几句，讲几个笑话。

1462
01:06:15.600 --> 01:06:19.280
He tells D'Angelo, you might want to develop a couple of characters.
他告诉迪安杰洛，你或许该塑造几个角色。

1463
01:06:19.980 --> 01:06:24.120
They end up hugging it out in a really kind of awkward, weird hug.
他们最后拥抱在了一起，那拥抱既尴尬又奇怪。

1464
01:06:24.240 --> 01:06:26.180
It's like a, I don't even know.
就像是，我甚至不知道该怎么形容。

1465
01:06:26.320 --> 01:06:28.760
It's like they're both facing the same way hug.
就像是两人都朝同一个方向抱在一起。

1466
01:06:29.000 --> 01:06:29.440
Yes.
是的。

1467
01:06:29.440 --> 01:06:31.560
And Michael's like, why'd you have to be so damn good?
迈克尔说，你为什么非要表现得这么出色呢？

1468
01:06:32.780 --> 01:06:35.080
They hold one another in this hug.
他们就这样拥抱着彼此。

1469
01:06:35.360 --> 01:06:38.060
And it seems as though everything's going to be okay.
看起来一切都会好起来的。

1470
01:06:38.840 --> 01:06:40.540
D'Angelo goes into the conference room.
迪安杰洛走进会议室。

1471
01:06:41.080 --> 01:06:42.620
Michael goes into his office.
迈克尔走进他的办公室。

1472
01:06:43.020 --> 01:06:46.240
And the transition of power has begun.
权力的交接已经开始了。

1473
01:06:46.660 --> 01:06:50.080
Well, the show's going to end with Jim and Pam bringing Cece in.
剧集会以吉姆和帕姆带着西西进来作为结尾。

1474
01:06:50.180 --> 01:06:53.720
This is their plan, you know, to finally really win over D'Angelo.
这是他们的计划，你知道的，为了最终彻底赢得迪安杰洛的好感。

1475
01:06:54.080 --> 01:06:56.260
D'Angelo says that's a cute baby.
迪安杰洛说那是个可爱的宝宝。

1476
01:06:56.680 --> 01:06:57.720
They're so happy.
他们非常高兴。

1477
01:06:57.860 --> 01:06:58.480
They fist pump.
他们碰拳庆祝。

1478
01:06:58.720 --> 01:06:59.280
They did it.
他们成功了。

1479
01:06:59.440 --> 01:07:00.060
They're in.
他们被接纳了。

1480
01:07:00.320 --> 01:07:03.060
But the episode ends with D'Angelo's talking head saying,
但剧集结尾是迪安杰洛的单人访谈，他说：

1481
01:07:03.400 --> 01:07:07.300
that baby could be the star of a show called Babies I Don't Care About.
那个宝宝可以去演一部叫《我不在乎的宝宝们》的剧。

1482
01:07:08.900 --> 01:07:11.080
And that, my friends, is training day.
朋友们，这就是“培训日”。

1483
01:07:11.300 --> 01:07:13.880
I want to let you know, in case you were curious,
我想让你们知道，以防你们好奇，

1484
01:07:14.340 --> 01:07:16.660
Miles McNutt gave this episode a C+.
迈尔斯·麦克纳特给这一集打了C+。

1485
01:07:17.320 --> 01:07:17.840
What?
什么？

1486
01:07:18.200 --> 01:07:18.820
I know.
我知道。

1487
01:07:19.180 --> 01:07:21.040
Miles, I loved this episode.
迈尔斯，我很喜欢这一集。

1488
01:07:21.280 --> 01:07:21.760
Me too.
我也是。

1489
01:07:21.980 --> 01:07:23.240
It has no Todd Packer.
这一集里没有托德·帕克。

1490
01:07:23.320 --> 01:07:24.440
What's your problem with it?
你对它有什么不满？

1491
01:07:24.440 --> 01:07:29.240
I have to tell you, I'm now obsessed with knowing what Miles thinks of every episode.
我得告诉你，我现在沉迷于想知道迈尔斯对每一集的看法。

1492
01:07:29.480 --> 01:07:30.600
It's become a new thing for me.
这成了我的新爱好。

1493
01:07:30.720 --> 01:07:31.540
I want to know.
我想知道。

1494
01:07:31.660 --> 01:07:32.480
I want to know.
我想知道。

1495
01:07:32.580 --> 01:07:33.900
How did he feel about it?
他对此感觉如何？

1496
01:07:34.160 --> 01:07:34.660
I don't know.
我不知道。

1497
01:07:34.920 --> 01:07:37.800
When are we going to get an A from Miles is what I want to know.
我想知道我们什么时候才能从迈尔斯那里得到一个A。

1498
01:07:38.420 --> 01:07:39.140
Maybe never.
也许永远不会。

1499
01:07:39.140 --> 01:07:39.500
Is it going to take?
这需要多久？

1500
01:07:39.900 --> 01:07:41.920
Is it going to be Michael's last dundies?
这会是迈克尔最后一次邓迪奖颁奖礼吗？

1501
01:07:42.120 --> 01:07:43.480
Is it going to be goodbye, Michael?
迈克尔，这是要告别了吗？

1502
01:07:43.800 --> 01:07:44.700
I'll let you know.
我会让你知道的。

1503
01:07:45.140 --> 01:07:45.760
We'll see.
走着瞧吧。

1504
01:07:45.880 --> 01:07:46.720
I can't wait to hear.
我迫不及待想听听结果了。

1505
01:07:46.980 --> 01:07:50.920
Well, a big thank you to Randy Cordray, Ellie Kemper, and Ed Helms
非常感谢兰迪·科德雷、艾丽·坎伯和艾德·赫尔姆斯

1506
01:07:50.920 --> 01:07:54.320
for giving us some nice little tidbits for this episode.
为本集节目提供了一些精彩的小花絮。

1507
01:07:54.500 --> 01:07:57.460
And if you have the DVD, go watch the extended cut.
如果你有DVD，一定要去看看加长版。

1508
01:07:57.600 --> 01:07:59.100
There's a lot of fun stuff in there.
里面有很多有趣的内容。

1509
01:07:59.260 --> 01:08:02.760
We will be back next week with Michael's last dundies.
下周我们将回归，带来迈克尔的最后一次邓迪奖颁奖礼。

1510
01:08:03.000 --> 01:08:05.360
Oh my gosh, I can't believe it.
天哪，我简直不敢相信。

1511
01:08:05.620 --> 01:08:06.560
See you then.
到时候见。

